    comment "en" """
        Source N342A SNOMED CT 31822004 = inflammation of the external urethral meatus, a Swedish extension
        of N34.2 Other urethritis. Target SNOMED CT 195862 (31822004) is the Athena crosswalk target for
        parent N34.2. Target is broader (it covers urethral inflammation generally, not specifically the
        external meatus); no meatus-specific inflammation standard concept found in the mirror. : real
        semantic distance from the regional specificity of the source.
        """
}
